# Virtual alias rewrites that need no per-user LDAP attribute.  Postfix
# tries virtual_alias_maps in order and stops at the first hit: the LDAP
# map (real mailboxes and `mailAlias`) first, this file second, so a real
# mailbox is never rewritten here.
#
# PCRE; postfix lowercases the key before matching.

# RFC 2142 role addresses to a real mailbox:
# /^(postmaster|abuse|hostmaster|webmaster|security)@example\.org$/  admin@example.org

# A whole mirror domain:
# /^(.+)@example\.net$/  $1@example.org
